# Copy to .env.local and fill in. Nothing here is required to drive the robot.

# Surge risk in the run setup panel: current conditions and rain forecast over
# the entry point. Advisory only, it never blocks a run. Leave it unset and the
# surge risk block does not render at all, which is the right behaviour for a
# console that spends its life on a network with no route to the internet.
# Key from https://openweathermap.org/api (free tier is enough).
VITE_OPENWEATHER_KEY=
